# Catalog

- Default: `Godot/hermetic-rifts/data/catalog/*.json`. Web `web/src/data/*.json` + `schema.ts` only when the prompt names web / both.
- New enemy/item/survivor = JSON entry. Do not add stats in sim classes.
- New skill effect = Godot sim case + JSON + `knowledge/tech/catalog.md`. Web `SkillEffect` / `applyEffect` only on a web-named task.
- Unknown effect types must throw at load, never silently no-op.
- Items use `add` / `pct` / `on-kill` / `on-crit` hooks. No screen-clear or AFK-win hooks.
